WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.348 --> 00:00:03.489
Danny: Help!

2
00:00:03.529 --> 00:00:06.351
Tina: I’ve got you!

3
00:00:06.411 --> 00:00:16.560
Don’t let go!

4
00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:20.423
Brad: Trust me.

5
00:00:21.504 --> 00:00:22.845
I will hold on tight.

6
00:00:22.865 --> 00:00:24.866
Tina: All right, guys.

7
00:00:25.547 --> 00:00:26.788
I’m going to pull you up.

8
00:00:27.469 --> 00:00:31.372
Brad: It’s not working.

9
00:00:32.544 --> 00:00:33.605
Tina: You’re too heavy.

10
00:00:33.645 --> 00:00:35.666
Danny: Try again.

11
00:00:35.686 --> 00:00:39.368
Tina: I’m going to try something different.

12
00:00:41.049 --> 00:00:44.091
Brad: Are you sure this is safe?

13
00:00:44.111 --> 00:00:46.692
Danny: Just hang on tight, Brad.

14
00:00:53.616 --> 00:00:55.317
Brad: That was really scary.

15
00:00:55.337 --> 00:00:57.518
Tina: You’re okay now, Brad.

16
00:00:57.538 --> 00:00:59.239
Danny: Thanks, Tina.

17
00:00:59.479 --> 00:01:00.460
You saved us.

18
00:01:01.932 --> 00:01:04.694
Tina: Well, I told you we would make it to the top.

19
00:01:04.934 --> 00:01:08.636
Danny: Let’s keep going.

20
00:01:10.337 --> 00:01:13.419
Tina: This isn’t good.

21
00:01:13.439 --> 00:01:16.520
Brad: I don’t like this mountain.

22
00:01:17.381 --> 00:01:20.683
Danny: Watch out!

23
00:01:24.285 --> 00:01:29.128
Brad: Did I mention that I don’t like this mountain?

24
00:01:31.692 --> 00:01:33.613
Danny: It’s too big to climb over.

25
00:01:33.633 --> 00:01:36.615
Tina: What if you made a ladder out of the clay?

26
00:01:36.635 --> 00:01:38.716
Brad: Or you could make ropes.

27
00:01:40.097 --> 00:01:42.258
Danny: I don’t have enough magic clay for that.

28
00:01:42.278 --> 00:01:44.499
Tina: How much do you have left?

29
00:01:44.519 --> 00:01:46.100
Danny: Not much.

30
00:01:46.820 --> 00:01:51.143
I have a few tiny pieces of red clay [n3@and one lump of yellow clay.

31
00:01:51.163 --> 00:01:54.565
Danny: But I need to save it if we’re going to defeat Tristay.

32
00:01:54.585 --> 00:01:59.867
Tina: The red clay looks like little seeds.

33
00:02:00.768 --> 00:02:02.230
Brad: That gives me an idea.

34
00:02:03.151 --> 00:02:05.653
If you made some seeds, we could plant them.

35
00:02:06.334 --> 00:02:09.578
Brad: Then maybe a vine would grow to the top of the mountain.

36
00:02:09.598 --> 00:02:11.480
Danny: Good idea!

37
00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:14.824
We could climb up, just like in “Jack and the Beanstalk.”

38
00:02:38.252 --> 00:02:38.832
Tina: That’s so pretty!

39
00:02:38.852 --> 00:02:41.914
Brad: And it looks safe!

40
00:02:42.554 --> 00:02:44.035
We’ll have no problem now.

41
00:02:45.116 --> 00:02:51.360
Danny: Wow!

42
00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:53.041
We’re really high!

43
00:02:53.061 --> 00:02:55.322
Brad: We’re almost there.

44
00:02:58.284 --> 00:03:06.552
Danny: Quick, we’ve got to rescue Hopian and Bello.

45
00:03:06.572 --> 00:03:07.933
Tina: Keep an eye open for Tristay.

46
00:03:07.953 --> 00:03:11.935
Brad: And watch out for those evil creatures.

47
00:03:11.955 --> 00:03:16.438
Danny: It doesn’t look as if anyone is here.

48
00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:24.622
Look! Danny: Oh no!

49
00:03:24.642 --> 00:03:27.664
Tina: We’re too late!
